    "message": "Raise the staff dynamics config's errors in the Python rule's order and words\n\ncanonical_config now checks in the order of canonical_staff_dynamics_config and\nraises its ValueError texts; a value of a type the Python rule may accept still\nsays Unsupported. validate_override raises the count and 16 KiB texts. The\nconfig and override tests compare each text with the rule's.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
