    "message": "Merge feature/rust-port (L8a, L7, #353) into lane L8b and reconcile the shared exit\n\nerrors.rs is L8a's merged file with L8b's section after it; L8b's checks use\nL8a's exactly_int, int_not_bool and real_number, and drop their own copies and\ntwo unused classes. kernel_first takes L8a's before/after form of the check:\n_error_check has the same form, _fell_back is an object, and with all three\nNone the wrapper is the plain try/except. segments.py follows. The error\ncomparison gains a strict mode, in Python and in the driver's or_rule!.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
